1
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:07,020
Buona sera, Luigi's Pizza.

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,550
Buona sera.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:11,440
(Sheldon:)It means good evening
in Italian.

4
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,110
(Sheldon:)May I say, having to explain
that to you calls into question

5
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:17,320
the authenticity
of your ristorante?

6
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,610
(Leonard:)Okay, I'm out of here.

7
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:21,260
Un momento.

8
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,730
(Sheldon:)Oh, for heaven's sake.

9
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:24,770
(Sheldon:)Now you're being
deliberately stupid.

10
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:27,200
(Sheldon:)Where are you going?

11
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,700
(Leonard:)I'm having dinner
with Priya at Raj's.

12
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:30,710
(Leonard:)I think Howard's going to be
there. You want to join us?

13
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:32,240
(Sheldon:)But tonight's Thursday.

14
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,040
(Sheldon:)On Thursdays, everybody
comes over here

15
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,480
(Sheldon:)and has pizza.

16
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,950
(Sheldon:)Or a reasonable facsimile

17
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:39,150
(Sheldon:)prepared by someone claiming
to be Luigi,

18
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,880
(Sheldon:)but who sounds suspiciously
like Jackie Chan.

19
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:45,090
(Leonard:)Can't we make a one-time
exception for tonight?

20
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:46,490
(Sheldon:)We could.

21
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:48,810
(Sheldon:)We could also
stop using the letter "M,"

22
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:52,860
but I think that idea is
isguided and oronic.

23
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,460
(Leonard:)Just come with me to Raj's.

24
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,850
(Sheldon:)Well, I don't want
to go to a party.

25
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:58,900
(Leonard:)It's not a party.
It's the same group of people

26
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,520
(Leonard:)who hang out here
hanging out over there.

27
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:04,110
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, but five people
eating and chatting is a party.

